  "title": "Decadent Pumpkin Muffins",
  "description": "I love pumpkin muffins, and I wanted to create a version with less fat and calories that still tasted good. These muffins turn out moist and full of flavor!",
  "authors": [
    "JRS22302"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:10:33-04:00",
